  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Valley_Shop?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9c/Token_Wallet.png/revision/latest?cb=20190625055916\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Token Wallet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Token Wallet\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9c/Token_Wallet.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20190625055916\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Token Wallet</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>valley shop</b> is where you can purchase items with <a href=\"/wiki/token-31466\" title=\"Token\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tokens</a>.&#160;It can be found by tapping the button on top next to token number in valley. The shop has two stores: the normal store and the seasonal store.\n</p><p>At the end of a valley season, players are required to spend all of their tokens in valley shop until they don't have enough tokens to buy any item there. Then, they can leave valley and wait for the next season.\n</p><p>The valley shop is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 25.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Normal store</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players can buy <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/boosters-27089\" title=\"Boosters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boosters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/puzzle-piece-28177\" title=\"Puzzle Piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">puzzle piece</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a> in the normal store. You need to spend one-color tokens or three colors of them that are order in the shop.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"650px\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Number\n</th>\n<th>Token Cost<br>(in total)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fb/Axe.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130205\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Axe\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fb/Axe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191028130205\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fc/Dynamite.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130301\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dynamite\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fc/Dynamite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191028130301\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0a/Saw.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130211\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Saw\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/77/Shovel.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130218\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shovel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/69/TNT_Barrel.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130224\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"TNT Barrel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Pickaxe.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712181933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pickaxe\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>450\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e0/Land_Deed.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130945\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Land Deed\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7b/Mallet.png/revision/latest?cb=20240425125251\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mallet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/91/Marker_Stake.png/revision/latest?cb=20240425125453\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Marker Stake\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1 (Common)<br>or 3 (Rare)\n</td>\n<td>650\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/8e/Bolt.png/revision/latest?cb=20180211180351\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bolt\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4e/Duct_Tape.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130855\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Duct Tape\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0d/Plank.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130900\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plank\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/40/Nail.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130907\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Nail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/59/Screw.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130937\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screw\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/02/Wood_Panel.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131042\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wood Panel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>650\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3a/Expansion_Permit.png/revision/latest?cb=20170324165909\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Expansion Permit\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>850\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3-star <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/00/Blue_Booster.png/revision/latest?cb=20171219232857\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue Booster\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>/<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0a/Golden_Booster.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20171019091509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Golden Booster\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fe/Puzzle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20170707200936\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puzzle Piece\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>850\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Garden_Bench.png/revision/latest?cb=20150714235045\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Garden Bench\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b4/Bonsai_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20160308204825\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bonsai Tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>660\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2b/Ditch.png/revision/latest?cb=20150912153909\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Ditch\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>550\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/af/Lush_Fern.png/revision/latest?cb=20180207190503\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lush Fern\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>360\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/01/Golden_Path.png/revision/latest?cb=20150715000345\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Golden Path\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4e/Rose_Fence_White.png/revision/latest?cb=20150715001042\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rose Fence White\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>500\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Seasonal store</b></span></h3>\n<p>Items in the seasonal store are locked until the players collected 100 chickens (50 in trial season) or delivered 400 sanctuary animals. Players can only purchase items there at the end of valley season. The store offers 3 special items every season. Each item can only be purchased once, unless you have sufficient coins in your&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/piggy-bank-32335\" title=\"Piggy Bank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Piggy Bank</a>, then you have the possibility of purchasing 2 items in the&#160;seasonal store.\n</p><p>The three rewards are:\n</p>\n<ul><li>30 diamonds. It requires a total of 3,600 tokens.</li>\n<li>Three 5-star <a href=\"/wiki/boosters-27089\" title=\"Boosters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boosters</a>. It requires a total of 3,150 tokens.</li>\n<li>One new decoration + 10 diamonds. It requires a total of 3,300 tokens.</li></ul>\n<p>In trial season, 5 puzzle pieces and 3 expansion permits replaces diamonds and boosters. In season 1-8, there are 40 diamonds instead of 30 and decoration does not include the 10 diamonds. Detailed rewards are listed below.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Season\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"3\">Rewards\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trial\n</td>\n<td>5 puzzle pieces\n</td>\n<td>Valentine Wagon decoration\n</td>\n<td>3 expansion permits\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1st\n</td>\n<td>40 diamonds\n</td>\n<td>Valley Train decoration\n</td>\n<td>Three 5-star boosters\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2nd\n</td>\n<td>40 diamonds\n</td>\n<td>Valley Train decoration\n</td>\n<td>Three 5-star boosters\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3rd\n</td>\n<td>40 diamonds\n</td>\n<td>Valley Boat decoration\n</td>\n<td>Three 5-star boosters\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4th\n</td>\n<td>40 diamonds\n</td>\n<td>Valley Plane decoration\n</td>\n<td>Three 5-star boosters\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5th\n</td>\n<td>40 diamonds\n</td>\n<td>Valley Scooter decoration\n</td>\n<td>Three 5-star boosters\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6th\n</td>\n<td>40 diamonds\n</td>\n<td>Valley Balloon decoration\n</td>\n<td>Three 5-star boosters\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7th\n</td>\n<td>40 diamonds\n</td>\n<td>Hiker Pig decoration\n</td>\n<td>Three 5-star booster